  "details": "1.) Internet fails\n\n2.) VRChat attempts to reconnect to instance\n\n3.) Reconnect fails\n\n4.) VRChat attempts to reconnect with a 15s auto reconnect message (no way to escape from here)\n\n5.) Repeats 3-4 forever/until game is closed\n\nWhen my internet has an issue and causes me to disconnect from the VRC servers vrchat attempts to reconnect. When this occurs and fails on the first reconnect attempt I get stuck in a loop where vrchat attempts to reconnect to the instance and fails and then attempts to reconnect to the same instance again forever. There is no way of getting out of this loop without closing the game. I never reach a point where i can access a menu or click go home.",
